sideration and then transfer the same to Riyasat Infra Developers Pvt. Ltd. Riyasat Infra Developers Pvt. Ltd will have the ownership right on remaining plots (other than Plot no 207 to 315 and Future planning), and will receive the consideration from transfer of plots. 5. that there is no approach road for Future Planning Area. Lease deed will be issued after finalization of approach road.6.With reference above point no. 01 in this regard 23 Plots (Plot no. 151, 267 to 270, 272 to 286, 292, 293, 294,  area is 3225.74 Sq. Mtr equalling to 6.47% are mortgage free by JDA vide letter No. JDA/DC/ZONE-14/02539/2025/D-2491 dated 22-08-2025. out of 44 plots, and 21 plots,( Plot No. 271, 287, 288, 289, 290, 295 to 310) are still non sanctioned with the competent authority. 6. 21 plots,( Plot No. 271, 287, 288, 289, 290, 295 to 310), area is 3008.63 Sq. Mtr equalling to 6.04% are mortgage free by JDA vide letter No. JDA/DC/ZONE-22/2025/D-23 dated 26-12-2025. And 23 Plots. plot no. 59, 78, 79, 111, 112, 136, 247, 248, 255 To 264, 276, 277, 287, 313, 314, S-01, S-29, S-30 are effected by L.T Line , Therefore NOC received from JVVNL-Sanganer department vide Letter No. 2001 dated 19.09.2025.  ","floors":"","basement":0,"plinth":0,"podium":0,"stilt":0,"parkingOpen":0,"parkingClose":0,"cars":0,"twoWheelers":0,"visitorCars":0,"buildingDocs":0,"constructionCost":null,"costByType":{"LandCost":182263390,"DevelopmentCost":230000000},"costDetail":[{"n":"Estimated Land Cost","t":"LandCost","e":182263390.0,"a":0.0},{"n":"For the purposes of sub-clause (D) of clause (I) of sub-section (2) of section 4, the land cost shall be the cost incurred by the promoter whether as an outright purchase, lease charges etc.","t":"LandCost","e":0.0,"a":0.0},{"n":"Revenue or area share given to land owner in lieu of land under any kind of agreement such as Joint Venture, Joint Development etc, in case the Promoter is not the owner of the land.","t":"LandCost","e":0.0,"a":0.0},{"n":"Amount paid to land owne